    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a haunting journey that challenges your sanity, where every level is a riddle waiting to be solved and every moment is filled with unsettling uncertainty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/484e6dbde0c2357f32c2e7664a625109.poster.avif?t=1755164249\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/484e6dbde0c2357f32c2e7664a625109.webm?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/484e6dbde0c2357f32c2e7664a625109.mp4?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You find yourself trapped in a dark, twisted dreamscape, an endless maze of dimly lit hallways and desolate rooms that seem to stretch on forever. Each step forward is hesitant, as the very environment feels alive, intent on confusing and disorienting you. The oppressive atmosphere weighs heavily, with shadows that flicker and dance, and every creak and whisper echoing from unseen corners fills you with unease. It's a world where even the air seems to pulse with dread, and the question is not only where you are but whether you can truly escape.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/6c6a84a66a0a9c84d772d3fe9f054cac.poster.avif?t=1755164249\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/6c6a84a66a0a9c84d772d3fe9f054cac.webm?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/6c6a84a66a0a9c84d772d3fe9f054cac.mp4?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the eerie mystery of the classic backrooms, this game turns every door into a gamble and every room into a potential nightmare. There is a constant, unshakable feeling that something is watching, always lurking just out of sight. The silence is broken only by the occasional distant sound\u2014a reminder that you're not alone. The only way to survive is to stay calm, think clearly, and press forward, but each decision feels like a step deeper into the unknown. Beware, because you won\u2019t always know where you're heading, and sometimes, turning back might not be an option.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you uncover the hidden secrets of these shifting levels before it\u2019s too late? The dynamics here are elusive, and only those with sharp minds and steady nerves can hope to make it through unscathed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare yourself to lose your sense of direction, solve cryptic puzzles, and confront your deepest fears as you venture deeper into the unknown. This is more than a game; it is a test of your wits and courage, challenging you to unravel the mystery before you become a part of it forever.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/5032751aab7ae2e52015a5112f5d49e9.poster.avif?t=1755164249\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/5032751aab7ae2e52015a5112f5d49e9.webm?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/5032751aab7ae2e52015a5112f5d49e9.mp4?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a haunting journey that challenges your sanity, where every level is a riddle waiting to be solved and every moment is filled with unsettling uncertainty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/484e6dbde0c2357f32c2e7664a625109.poster.avif?t=1755164249\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/484e6dbde0c2357f32c2e7664a625109.webm?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/484e6dbde0c2357f32c2e7664a625109.mp4?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You find yourself trapped in a dark, twisted dreamscape, an endless maze of dimly lit hallways and desolate rooms that seem to stretch on forever. Each step forward is hesitant, as the very environment feels alive, intent on confusing and disorienting you. The oppressive atmosphere weighs heavily, with shadows that flicker and dance, and every creak and whisper echoing from unseen corners fills you with unease. It's a world where even the air seems to pulse with dread, and the question is not only where you are but whether you can truly escape.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/6c6a84a66a0a9c84d772d3fe9f054cac.poster.avif?t=1755164249\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/6c6a84a66a0a9c84d772d3fe9f054cac.webm?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/6c6a84a66a0a9c84d772d3fe9f054cac.mp4?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the eerie mystery of the classic backrooms, this game turns every door into a gamble and every room into a potential nightmare. There is a constant, unshakable feeling that something is watching, always lurking just out of sight. The silence is broken only by the occasional distant sound\u2014a reminder that you're not alone. The only way to survive is to stay calm, think clearly, and press forward, but each decision feels like a step deeper into the unknown. Beware, because you won\u2019t always know where you're heading, and sometimes, turning back might not be an option.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you uncover the hidden secrets of these shifting levels before it\u2019s too late? The dynamics here are elusive, and only those with sharp minds and steady nerves can hope to make it through unscathed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare yourself to lose your sense of direction, solve cryptic puzzles, and confront your deepest fears as you venture deeper into the unknown. This is more than a game; it is a test of your wits and courage, challenging you to unravel the mystery before you become a part of it forever.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/5032751aab7ae2e52015a5112f5d49e9.poster.avif?t=1755164249\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/5032751aab7ae2e52015a5112f5d49e9.webm?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257160/extras/5032751aab7ae2e52015a5112f5d49e9.mp4?t=1755164249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Step into a nightmare where every level hides a deadly secret. Trapped in a twisted maze of endless corridors and eerie rooms, every door you open could be your last, and every step could lead you deeper into danger. Can you stay calm, solve the mysteries, and find a way out ?",
